 "text": "Press Alt+1 for screen-reader mode, Alt+0 to cancel Accessibility Screen-Reader Guide, Feedback, and Issue Reporting | New window D3 Meet Us Services Our Work Blog Careers Contact Us REQUEST A QUOTE Answer Engine Optimization Expert AEO Services with D3 The evolution of Search Engine Optimization (SEO) for AI-powered search tools begins with an Answer Engine Optimization (AEO) strategy. AEO doesn’t replace SEO— it builds on the essential foundations that make your business discoverable. D3 can hone your website content and digital presence to ensure that AI tools see your business as real, relevant, and trusted, so that you will be cited as an answer in large language models and search tools such as ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, and more. Go Beyond SEO: How Our AEO/GEO Service Works AI tools rely on SEO signals that carry over to AEO, such as a well-structured website, consistent business information, customer reviews, and quality content that clearly explains what you do. SEO (Search Engine Optimization): Boosts your website ranking on search results. AEO (Answer Engine Optimization): Helps your business and website content show up as a direct answer. GEO (Generative Engine Optimization): Adjusting content for AI models to consume accurately. Why Invest in AEO? AI tools are influencing how people choose businesses, and search engines and voice assistants have changed how answers are shown. Businesses that explain themselves clearly will be suggested over their competitors, and recommended more often for their services and strengths. D3 Offers AEO That Delivers Improve visibility on AI-powered search and voice platforms Build credibility and trust with customers online Stand out from competitors with accurate, citable information Our team can start optimizing your site to make AI platforms know your business. Contact D3, or chat with our AI Assistant to get started. Learn More About MD’s Top-Rated AEO Experts Company Name Contact Person Position/Title City State Phone Email Preferred Method of Contact Preferred Method of Contact Phone Email Current Website URL How Did You Discover D3? How Did You Discover D3? Google Search Social Media Word of Mouth Referral from a Friend or Colleague Event or Trade Show Walk-in / Drove By Print Advertisement Email Newsletter From Another Business Existing Client Comments This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. SUBMIT Case Studies Precision-Driven AEO Services That Deliver BOARDWALK HOTEL GROUP Building on a long-standing relationship, D3 led a comprehensive overhaul of Boardwalk Hotel Group’s four websites, refreshing photography and video, restructuring and streamlining extensive content, and updating design to better meet evolving guest expectations. The project showcased our project management strength and expertise while integrating seamlessly with ongoing marketing efforts to ensure cohesion across all initiatives. The result is a modern, unified website experience that maintains strong search performance, aligns with industry standards, and continues to drive... VIEW CASE STUDY SOMERSET COUNTY TOURISM Located along Maryland’s Eastern Shore, Somerset County offers a destination defined by waterfront beauty, local culture, and small-town charm. As competition for travelers’ attention increased, D3 partnered with Somerset County Tourism to elevate the brand through a cohesive, multi-channel strategy. Together, we combined compelling storytelling, vibrant visuals, and targeted digital marketing to reach key feeder markets, sparking discovery, inspiring travel, and positioning Somerset County as a destination worth slowing down for. VIEW CASE STUDY JOLLY ROGER AMUSEMENTS A familiar legend, newly charted: D3 reimagined Jolly Roger® Amusement Parks, a beloved Ocean City, MD brand, for a new generation of visitors. Over the years, Jolly Roger’s digital presence had expanded across multiple sister websites representing all of its parks and attractions. We envisioned a solution to reduce complexity from both a management and maintenance perspective, and to modernize the famed amusement park’s brand presence. VIEW CASE STUDY OLD PRO GOLF Old Pro Golf has been delighting families in Ocean City, MD, since 1963. D3 helped bring their iconic courses into the modern era with a refreshed brand, vibrant photography, a dynamic new website, and playful social storytelling. From immersive course visuals to an online scorecard and streamlined event booking, every touchpoint celebrates nostalgia while engaging a new generation of mini-golfers. VIEW CASE STUDY CASTLE IN THE SAND HOTEL The Castle in the Sand Hotel has been an iconic Ocean City, MD destination for generations. Owned and operated by the Showell family, the hotel is known for its stunning oceanfront location, close to all the action, its variety of accommodations, and its family-friendly atmosphere. VIEW CASE STUDY 1 2 3 4 5 Stand Out in AI Search With D3’s AEO Services Submit the form below, or give us a call at 410-213-2400 First Name Last Name Company Name Phone Email How Did You Hear About D3? How Did You Hear About D3?* Google Search Social Media Word of Mouth Referral from a Friend or Colleague Event or Trade Show Walk-In / Drove By Print Advertisement Email Newsletter From Another Business Existing Client I'm Interested in the following Services: This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. SUBMIT Subscribe Get the latest marketing news and advice. First Name Last Name Email SUBSCRIBE This site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google Privacy Policy and Terms of Service apply. 12319 Ocean Gateway, Suite 202 Ocean City, Maryland 21842 410-213-2400 212 West Main Street Salisbury, Maryland 21801 Meet Us Testimonials Services Case Studies Videos ID3AS Blog Careers Contact Us Privacy Policy Terms & Conditions Webmail Accessibility Site Map Copyright © 2026 D3. All Rights Reserved. Website Design 